[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

The reindeer, also known as the caribou, is a species of deer with circumpolar distribution, native to Arctic, sub-Arctic, tundra, boreal and mountainous regions.
Reinder also spawn more commonly in the snows of Winter.

Their most important gameplay function is that they can be [[Taming|tamed]] to become a [[Tame Reindeer]].


==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Passive until you aggro them.

